crtsys provides CMake helpers and Visual Studio/MSBuild driver-model UI.

CMake:

  find_package(crtsys CONFIG REQUIRED)
  crtsys_add_driver(my_driver src/main.cpp)

Visual Studio/MSBuild manifest projects must use a static-CRT triplet. After
vcpkg install, run the initializer once from the manifest root:

  .\vcpkg_installed\x64-windows-static\tools\crtsys\crtsys-vs-init.cmd

Reload Visual Studio after the first install so the crtsys WDM/KMDF entry-point
property page is reevaluated. Re-run with a different -Triplet to change the
default, or pass -Remove to remove the generated integration. See
share/crtsys/readme.md for driver examples.
